# UI change is not a recolor

When the user asks for a UI change, do not only recolor.
Change layout, typography, density, and motion unless they say "theme only."
If they did not attach a visual reference, generate 2 mockups and wait.

Banned defaults: Inter, indigo-600, rounded-2xl card grids, generic hero + 3 features, `bg_nav_tile` + icon-in-circle hub chrome.

For a new visual identity, follow `.cursor/skills/visual-redesign/SKILL.md` and wait for a direction pick before writing production layouts.
